Those were the stats. As you can see from my high-score list, I sucked
big time so far on this machine.
I have no idea why it went so well, or it must have been the full
moon. Indeed, I was extremely lucky.

I found gauntlets of power, just lying on the floor in an empty room.
On top of that, the second time I prayed I received Mjollnir.
The only minor problem was identifying things. There were hardly any
scrolls, and it took a while before I could do the spell with some
chance of success. I learned the spell late in the game, a ways below
the Rogue level.
I found Trollsbane lying on the floor somewhere, close to a magic lamp
which yielded me GDSM. By then my pet was a tame water troll, and she
killed all priests and shopkeepers. I managed to keep one priest
alive, and eventually got my AC down to -37.
I had the Orb of Fate and Frost brand, and found Vorpal on a previous
character who had killed herself experimenting with throwing the thing
up in the air. That was Miriel, whom you see in the high-score list.
My first and only /oW was in the castle. I got lots of goodies, and
then wiped out L and ;.

Earth and Fire were easy, but Water took ages. I couldn't find the
darned portal. When I finally did, my luck seemed to change. The
correct altar was the third one, and I died two times getting to the
other ones.
With one spare amulet of life saving left I sacrificed the Amulet and
ascended - and couldn't believe it. Finally.



